   "source": [
    "# Seeruta App Executable Builder\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook provides step-by-step instructions to build an executable (exe) of the Seeruta Flutter app using PyInstaller and other packaging tools.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Overview\n",
    "This notebook will guide you through the process of converting your Flutter/Dart Seeruta app into a standalone executable that can be distributed and run on Windows systems without requiring Flutter/Dart installation.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Prerequisites\n",
    "1. **Windows 10/11** (for creating Windows executables)\n",
    "2. **Python 3.7 or higher**\n",
    "3. **PyInstaller** (will be installed)\n",
    "4. **Wheel** and **setuptools** (will be installed)\n",
    "5. **CMake** (for Flutter packaging)\n",
    "6. **Git** (for version control)\n",
    "\n",
    "## Step 1: Environment Setup\n",
    "\n",
    "### Install Required Python Packages\n",
    "```python\n",
    "import subprocess\n",
    "import sys\n",
    "\n",
    "print('Installing required packages...')\n",
    "\n",
    "# Install PyInstaller and related tools\n",
    "subprocess.check_call([sys.executable, '-m', 'pip', 'install', 'pyinstaller', 'wheel', 'setuptools', 'auto-py-to-exe', 'pyyaml'])\n",
    "\n",
    "print('Required packages installed successfully!')\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "### Clone Your Seeruta Repository\n",
    "```python\n",
    "import os\n",
    "import shutil\n",
    "\n",
    "print('Setting up project directory...')\n",
    "\n",
    "# Define project directory\n",
    "project_dir = r'C:\\Users\\Adminator\\Documents\\SeeRuta\\teammate'\n",
    "\n",
    "# Check if project exists\n",
    "if not os.path.exists(project_dir):\n",
    "    print(f'Error: Project directory not found: {project_dir}')\n",
    "    print('Please update the project_dir path in the script above.')\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'Project directory: {project_dir}')\n",
    "\n",
    "# Change to project directory\n",
    "os.chdir(project_dir)\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "## Step 2: Prepare Flutter/Dart Dependencies\n",
    "\n",
    "### Generate Flutter Assets\n",
    "```python\n",
    "import subprocess\n",
    "import json\n",
    "\n",
    "print('Generating Flutter assets...')\n",
    "\n",
    "# Try to run Flutter commands if available\n",
    "flutter_commands = ['flutter', 'flutter.bat']\n",
    "flutter_available = False\n",
    "\n",
    "for cmd in flutter_commands:\n",
    "    try:\n",
    "        result = subprocess.run([cmd, '--version'], capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=10)\n",
    "        if result.returncode == 0:\n",
    "            flutter_available = True\n",
    "            print(f'Flutter found: {cmd}')\n",
    "            break\n",
    "    except (subprocess.SubprocessError, FileNotFoundError):\n",
    "        continue\n",
    "\n",
    "if flutter_available:\n",
    "    # Generate app icon if needed\n",
    "    print('Generating app icon...')\n",
    "    # Add icon generation commands here\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # Generate localization files\n",
    "    print('Generating localization files...')\n",
    "    # Add localization commands here\n",
    "\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    print('Flutter not found. Make sure Flutter is installed and in PATH.')\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "### Create or Update build configuration\n",
    "```python\n",
    "import json\n",
    "\n",
    "# Create a build configuration\n",
    "build_config = {\n",
    "    \"project_name\": \"seeruta_app\",\n",
    "    \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n",
    "    \"description\": \"Seeruta offline map navigation and jeepney route planning app\",\n",
    "    \"author\": \"Seeruta Team\",\n",
    "    \"executable_name\": \"SeerutaApp.exe\",\n",
    "    \"icon_path\": \"assets/icon.ico\",\n",
    "    \"window_mode\": \"windowed\",\n",
    "    \"ui_type\": \"windows\",\n",
    "    \"dependencies\": [\n",
    "        \"requests==2.31.0\",\n",
    "        \"pandas==2.0.3\",\n",
    "        \"numpy==1.24.3\",\n",
    "        \"sqlite3==2.3.0\",\n",
    "        \"flask==2.3.2\",\n",
    "        \"geopy==2.3.0\",\n",
    "    ]\n",
    "}\n",
    "\n",
    "# Save configuration\n",
    "with open('build_config.json', 'w') as f:\n",
    "    json.dump(build_config, f, indent=4)\n",
    "\n",
    "print('Build configuration created.')\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "## Step 3: Create PyInstaller Spec\n",
    "\n",
    "### Create PyInstaller specification file\n",
    "```python\n",
    "import os\n",
    "\n",
    "print('Creating PyInstaller specification...')\n",
    "\n",
    "# Create PyInstaller spec file\n",
    "spec_content = '''\n",
    "    main_script = \"\"\"\\n",
    "main_script = \"\"\"\\n",
    "    spec_content = '''\\n',
    "    spec_content = '''\\n',
    "    ```\n",
    "\n",
    "# Write spec file\n",
    "with open('seeruta_app.spec', 'w') as f:\n",
    "    f.write(spec_content)\n",
    "\n",
    "print('PyInstaller spec file created.')\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "## Step 4: Build Executable\n",
    "\n",
    "### Basic PyInstaller setup\n",
    "```python\n",
    "import subprocess\n",
    "import sys\n",
    "\n",
    "print('Building executable using PyInstaller...')\n",
    "\n",
    "# Run PyInstaller to create executable\n",
    "try:\n",
    "    subprocess.check_call([sys.executable, '-m', 'PyInstaller', '--specpath', '.', '--name', 'SeerutaApp', '--windowed']\n",
    "    print('Executable built successfully!')\n",
    "except subprocess.CalledProcessError as e:\n",
    "    print(f'Error building executable: {e}')\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "### Advanced build configuration\n",
    "```python\n",
    "import subprocess\n",
    "\n",
    "print('Creating advanced build configuration...')\n",
    "\n",
    "# Create a more advanced PyInstaller spec\n",
    "advanced_spec = '''\\n",
    "block_cipher = None\n",
    "\n",
    "a = Analysis(\n",
    "    ['src/main.py'],  # Your main Python script\n",
    "    patheds=[\n",
    "        ('assets\\*.png', 'assets'),\n",
    "        ('assets\\*.ico', 'assets'),\n",
    "        ('lib\\*.py', 'lib'),\n",
    "        ('*.json', '.'),\n",
       "    ],\n",
    "    binaries=[\n",
    "        ('C:\\\\Users\\\\Adminator\\\\Documents\\\\SeeRuta\\\\teammate\\\\assets\\\\maps\\\\*.mbtiles', 'assets/maps'),\n",
    "    ],\n",
    "    datas=[\n",
    "        ('C:\\\\Users\\\\Adminator\\\\Documents\\\\SeeRuta\\\\teammate\\\\assets\\\\maps', 'assets/maps'),\n",
    "        ('C:\\\\Users\\\\Adminator\\\\Documents\\\\SeeRuta\\\\teammate\\\\assets\\*\\*.csv', 'assets'),\n",
    "    ],\n",
    "    hiddenimports=[\n",
    "        \"sqlite3\",\n",
    "        \"flask\",\n",
    "        \"pandas\",\n",
    "        \"geopy\",\n",
    "        \"geopy.point\",\n",
    "    ],\n",
    "    icon='assets/icon.ico',\n",
    "    name='SeerutaApp',\n",
    "    unicode_mode=False,\n",
    "    debug_mode=False,\n",
    "    bundle_mode='pybundle',\n",
    "    is_zip_safe=False,\n",
    \"\"\\n",
    "    execname='SeerutaApp',\n",
    "    \"\\n",
    "    a = Analysis(\n",
    "    ['src/main.py'],
    "    patheds=[\n",
    "        ('assets\\*.png', 'assets'),\n",
    "        ('assets\\*.ico', 'assets'),\n",
    "        ('lib\\*.py', 'lib'),\n",
    "    ],\n",
    "    datas=[\n",
    "        ('C:\\\\Users\\\\Adminator\\\\Documents\\\\SeeRuta\\\\teammate\\\\assets\\\\maps', 'assets/maps'),\n",
    "    ],\n",
    "    hiddenimports=[\n",
    "        \"sqlite3\",\n",
    "        \"flask\",\n",
    "        \"pandas\",\n",
    "        \"geopy\",\n",
    "    ],\n",
    "    icon='assets/icon.ico',\n",
    "    name='SeerutaApp',\n",
    "    unicode_mode=False,\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "pyz = PYZ(\n",
    "    a.pure,\n",
    "    a.zipped_datas,\n",
    "    cipher=block_cipher\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "exe = EXE(\n",
    "    PYZ,\n",
    "    a.scripts,\n",
    "    a.binaries,\n",
    "    a.datas,\n",
    "    [],\n",
    "    name='SeerutaApp',\n",
    "    debug=False,\n",
    "    bootloader_ignore_signals=False,\n",
    \"\\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "## Step 5: Install Additional Tools\n",
    "\n",
    "### Install 7-Zip for packaging\n",
    "```python\n",
    "import platform\n",
    "import subprocess\n",
    "\n",
    "print('Checking for 7-Zip...')\n",
    "\n",
    "# Check if 7-Zip is installed\n",
    "if platform.system() == \"Windows\":\n",
    "    try:\n",
    "        subprocess.run([\"7z\", \"--help\"], capture_output=True, check=True)\n",
    "        print('7-Zip is installed.')\n",
    "    except (subprocess.SubprocessError, FileNotFoundError):\n",
    "        print('7-Zip not found. Install it from https://www.7-zip.org/')\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "### Install additional packaging tools\n",
    "```python\n",
    "import subprocess\n",
    "\n",
    "print('Installing additional packaging tools...')\n",
    "\n",
    "# Install additional tools\n",
    "tools = [\n",
    "    \"nuitka\",      # For advanced compilation\n",
    "    \"cx-freeze\",   # Alternative to PyInstaller\n",
    "    \"py2exe\",     # Windows-specific\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "for tool in tools:\n",
    "    try:\n",
    "        subprocess.check_call([sys.executable, '-m', 'pip', 'install', tool])\n",
    "        print(f\"Installed {tool} successfully.\")\n",
    "    except subprocess.CalledProcessError:\n",
    "        print(f\"Failed to install {tool}.\")\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "## Step 6: Verify Build\n",
    "\n",
    "### Check build output\n",
    "```python\n",
    "import os\n",
    "\n",
    "print('Verifying build output...')\n",
    "\n",
    "# Check for build output\n",
    "build_dirs = ['build', 'dist', '__pycache__']\n",
    "\n",
    "for dir_name in build_dirs:\n",
    "    if os.path.exists(dir_name):\n",
    "        print(f'Found directory: {dir_name}')\n",
       "\n",
    "# List files in dist directory (where executable should be)\n",
    "if os.path.exists('dist'):\n",
    "    print('\\nFiles in dist directory:')\n",
    "    for file in os.listdir('dist'):\n",
    "        print(f'  - {file}')\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "## Step 7: Create Installer\n",
    "\n",
    "### Create a setup script\n",
    "```python\n",
    "print('Creating installer setup...')\n",
    "\n",
    "# Create a simple installer script\n",
    "installer_script = '''\\n",
    "@echo off\n",
    "echo Installing Seeruta App...\n",
    "echo This setup script will guide you through the installation process.\n",
    "echo.\n",
    "echo Please select your installation options:\n",
    "echo 1. Install to default location\n",
    "echo 2. Custom location\n",
    "echo 3. Silent installation\n",
    "echo.\n",
    "set /p choice=Enter your choice (1-3):\n",
    "\n",
    "if \"%choice%\"==\"1\" goto :default\n",
    "if \"%choice%\"==\"2\" goto :custom\n",
    "if \"%choice%\"==\"3\" goto :silent\n",
    "\n",
    ":default\n",
    "echo Installing to default location...\n",
    "xcopy /E /I /Q dist\\SeerutaApp.exe \"%PROGRAMFILES%\\Seeruta App\\\"\n",
    "goto :end\n",
    "\n",
    ":custom\n",
    "set /p path=Enter installation path: C:\\Program Files\\Seeruta App\n",
    "xcopy /E /I /Q dist\\SeerutaApp.exe \"%path%\\\"\n",
    "goto :end\n",
    "\n",
    ":silent\n",
    "xcopy /E /I /Q dist\\SeerutaApp.exe \"%PROGRAMFILES%\\Seeruta App\\\" /quiet\n",
    "goto :end\n",
    "\n",
    ":end\n",
    "echo Installation complete.\n",
    "pause\n",
    "''\n",
    "\n",
    "# Write installer script\n",
    "with open('setup.bat', 'w') as f:\n",
    "    f.write(installer_script)\n",
    "\n",
    "print('Installer script created.')\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "## Step 8: Distribution\n",
    "\n",
    "### Prepare distribution package\n",
    "```python\n",
    "import zipfile\n",
    "import os\n",
    "\n",
    "print('Creating distribution package...')\n",
    "\n",
    "# Create a distribution zip file\n",
    "with zipfile.ZipFile('SeerutaApp_Distribution.zip', 'w') as zipf:\n",
    "    # Add executable\n",
    "    if os.path.exists('dist\\SeerutaApp.exe'):\n",
    "        zipf.write('dist\\SeerutaApp.exe', 'SeerutaApp.exe')\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # Add additional files\n",
    "    for file in ['README.md', 'LICENSE', 'CHANGELOG.txt']:\n",
    "        if os.path.exists(file):\n",
    "            zipf.write(file, file)\n",
    "\n",
    "print('Distribution package created: SeerutaApp_Distribution.zip')\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "## Step 9: Final Verification\n",
    "\n",
    "### Test the executable\n",
    "```python\n",
    "import subprocess\n",
    "\n",
    "print('Testing the built executable...')\n",
    "\n",
    "# Try to run the executable (if available)\n",
    "if os.path.exists('dist\\SeerutaApp.exe'):\n",
    "    try:\n",
    "        # This will show the executable info\n",
    "        subprocess.run(['dist\\\\SeerutaApp.exe', '--help'], timeout=5)\n",
    "    except (subprocess.SubprocessError, FileNotFoundError):\n",
    "        print('Executable test completed.')\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    print('Executable not found. Please check the build process.')\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "## Troubleshooting\n",
    "\n",
    "### Common Issues\n",
    "1. **Missing dependencies**:\n",
    "   - Ensure all required Python packages are listed in requirements.txt\n",
    "   - Install packages with: `pip install -r requirements.txt`\n",
    "\n",
    "2. **Import errors**:\n",
    "   - Check that your code doesn't rely on external tools not packaged\n",
    "   - Use `subprocess` for external commands when necessary\n",
    "\n",
    "3. **Large executable size**:\n",
    "   - Consider using `--onefile` PyInstaller option\n",
    "   - Remove unnecessary files and dependencies\n",
    "\n",
    "4. **Windows compatibility**:\n",
    "   - Test on Windows if possible\n",
    "   - Use Windows-specific packaging tools like NSIS\n",
    "\n",
    "## Conclusion\n",
    "Building a Windows executable for the Seeruta app involves multiple steps, from setting up the Python environment to creating installers and distribution packages. Follow this notebook carefully and troubleshoot any issues that arise during the build process.\n",
    "\n",
    "The resulting executable will be a standalone application that can be distributed to users without requiring them to install Flutter, Dart, or other development tools.\n",
    "\n",
    "Happy building! 🚀\n"
   ]
